      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The chemist injects a mixture of chemicals into its body. The first and second time the chemist injects itself within 24 hours, it gains 3d6 temporary hit points. The third time the chemist injects itself within 24 hours, the chemist explodes. Creatures within 10 feet of the chemist must make a DC 14 Dexterity saving throw, taking 18 (4d8) acid damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. Any other creature that consumes this cocktail takes 10 (3d6) poison damage.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
